    "created_at": "2024-12-19T16:51:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-19T16:51:04Z",
    "body": "> * `<button>`: In chrome+safari, buttons have user-select:auto in the UA stylesheet and text selection does not work when using the mouse but does when using the keyboard (select all). In firefox, buttons have user-select:none in the UA stylesheet and text selection does work if you change it to user-select:auto.\r\n\r\nThis is https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8228",
